{"id": 1006927, "slug": "black-pieces-move-first", "name": "Black Pieces Move First", "name_original": "Black Pieces Move First", "description": "<p>A humble black pawn decided to challenge the first rule of chess. The white pieces were not happy about this at all. The result? War.</p><h3>A PAWN WITH A GOAL</h3><p>Control the black pawn across various chessboards, following the rules of movement, defense, and attack from classical chess but with a twist: the black pawn has the movement capabilities of a king and can push black pieces, commanding them to attack on your orders.</p><h3>A SHOP TO GEAR UP</h3><p>The pawn is not alone!</p><h3>YOUR BRAIN WILL MELT!</h3><p>The puzzles will require logical thinking, agility, and creativity to find solutions and achieve the objective of each level (there are 60 levels with progressively increasing difficulty).</p><p>There is also a story mode with a world map, collectibles, and an item shop, where you can gather money to purchase upgrades as you progress through the game.</p><p><strong>Innovative chess-based game with a captivating story of rebellion.</strong></p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-16", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-07-18T12:25:49", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/30c/30c5864ff64fc62db6a42f4a9036677a.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e1f/e1ffb6ffab63db3292a7c5a7c8237439.jpg", "website": "https://enchantgames.org", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 54, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", 